    "description": "The compact application template contains final-state DDL built from tracked migrations and the Catalog and Checkout checkpoints. Its 233 referenced routine bodies resolve by byte range and SHA-256 against 35 tracked SQL source files. Six routines composed by historical renames or SQL transforms use their final source-reconstructed bodies directly. The renderer requires only the checkout. All 239 normalized deployed routine definitions and owners matched the parent catalog on 2026-11-20.",
    "scope": "Only public/private application, the empty maintenance metadata table, two application-owned storage policies, and two Auth hooks are part of this baseline. The unchanged parent project and legacy migration ledger are never bootstrap targets. Managed DDL, production account and product row data, credentials, Vault, scheduled jobs, email dispatch and HTTP hook destinations are excluded."
